+# against every trigonometric polynomial the nodes interpolate — and that
+# integral has a closed form: ∫₀^{2π} ln(4 sin²(τ/2)) cos(mτ) dτ = −2π/m for
+# m ≥ 1 and 0 for m = 0. Checking the weights against the closed form uses
